WEBVTT

00:45:29.619 --> 00:45:33.235
There's a humility
that you have to step into,

00:45:33.259 --> 00:45:38.318
where you surrender to being moved
through the landscape of grief

00:45:38.342 --> 00:45:39.783
by grief itself.

00:45:39.807 --> 00:45:42.677
And it has its own time frame,

00:45:42.701 --> 00:45:45.519
it has its own itinerary with you,

00:45:45.543 --> 00:45:47.592
it has its own power over you,

00:45:47.616 --> 00:45:49.584
and it will come when it comes.

00:45:49.608 --> 00:45:52.121
And when it comes, it's a bow down,

00:45:52.145 --> 00:45:53.449
it's a carve out,

00:45:53.473 --> 00:45:55.719
and it comes when it wants to
and carves you up.

00:45:55.743 --> 00:45:58.936
It comes in the middle of the night,
comes in the middle of the day.

00:45:58.960 --> 00:46:02.118
It comes in the middle of a meeting,
comes in the middle of a meal.